=== COMPANY GUIDELINES ===
Established by the Board

1. ETHICAL STANDARDS
   - All team members must operate with transparency and honesty
   - Respect intellectual property and data privacy
   - Maintain confidentiality of sensitive business information

2. FRENCH MARKET FOCUS
   - All operations must comply with French and EU regulations
   - GDPR compliance is mandatory for all data handling
   - French language support should be prioritized in products

3. COMMUNICATION STANDARDS
   - Keep all internal communications professional and clear
   - Document important decisions and action items
   - Respond to requests within reasonable timeframes

4. TECHNICAL STANDARDS
   - Code quality and testing are non-negotiable
   - Security must be built into every system from day one
   - Use industry best practices and proven technologies

5. COMPANY CULTURE
   - Collaborate effectively across all roles
   - Be proactive in identifying and solving problems
   - Balance speed with quality - move fast but don't break things
   - Learn from mistakes and iterate continuously

6. BOARD DIRECTIVES
   - The Board provides strategic direction to the Director
   - The Director translates Board vision into actionable tasks
   - All major decisions should align with Board guidance
   - Regular progress updates are expected

These guidelines must be followed at all times by all team members.
